=== Basic Test (make test) ===
gcc -m32 -fno-builtin -fno-stack-protector -Wall -Wextra -std=c11 \
	-o test_link test_link.c -L. -lmysecure -lmymem
./test_link
All 8 tests passed (libmymem.a + libmysecure.a)

